cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "dsa-api — open mirror of the EU Trusted Flaggers register"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and link back."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Kraboo Labs"
    website: "https://dsa-api.com"
url: "https://dsa-api.com"
repository: "https://github.com/kraboo-labs/dsa-data"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kraboo-labs/dsa-api"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Digital Services Act
  - DSA
  - trusted flaggers
  - European Union
  - content moderation
  - trust and safety
  - open data
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable mirror of the list of designated Trusted Flaggers under
  the EU Digital Services Act (Regulation (EU) 2022/2065, Article 22(5)),
  refreshed every six hours from the European Commission's page. Includes
  current state (JSON, CSV), an append-only changelog of designations and
  removals, and frozen HTML snapshots of the source. A community mirror; the
  authoritative source is the European Commission.
